      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If VRCFury is involved you can bring up a debug screen to look at the avatar parameters of the built avatar, and compare with the parameters file. \n\nThe main thing is that the order of the parameters needs to be the same, as the 256 bits of information is clocked into the parameters in order. So what I do is use the same parameters file on a quest version even if certain features are not available on Quest.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
