  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-04-08T05:22:37.610Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm having trouble with my avatar synchronization in VRChat. Despite trying various troubleshooting steps like using VRCFury, creating a new project, updating the SDK, and double-checking parameters, the issue persists. I'm starting to suspect that the problem might be with VRChat itself, perhaps due to an update.\n\nI'm wondering if there are any additional steps I haven't tried yet or if there might be a specific reason behind the synchronization problem, such as an update. I would greatly appreciate any help and i wanted to see if anyone has been having this problem as well and if they know how to fix it, as I've been dealing with this issue for a few days now.\n\nI hope this is easy to understand",
